# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Obsidian runtime state that must NOT be published.
#
# The vault lives in `notes/`, NOT at the repository root: Obsidian indexes and
# watches every file under the vault root, and garden/node_modules alone holds
# ~17.5k files. Keeping the vault in its own subdirectory is the only way to keep
# dependency READMEs out of the graph view and off the file watcher.
#
# The vault ships a *minimal* .obsidian so that cloning it and opening `notes/`
# in Obsidian Just Works. Everything listed below is per-machine personal state,
# which is why every path here is anchored under notes/.
#
# Deliberately NOT using a blanket `plugins/*/data.json` ignore: the Excalidraw
# plugin's data.json IS committed (it wires MindMap Builder into the sidepanel),
# and git's negation rules do not behave predictably for files inside an ignored
# directory. Listing the unwanted files explicitly avoids that trap entirely.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
notes/.obsidian/workspace.json
notes/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
notes/.obsidian/workspaces.json
notes/.obsidian/hotkeys.json
notes/.obsidian/graph.json
notes/.obsidian/backlink.json
notes/.obsidian/canvas.json
notes/.obsidian/page-preview.json
notes/.obsidian/types.json
notes/.obsidian/webviewer.json
notes/.obsidian/core-plugins-migration.json
notes/.obsidian/appearance.json
notes/.obsidian/community-plugins.json.bak

# Credentials live in plugin data files (the AI plugins store plaintext API
# keys). If you add any plugin beyond Excalidraw, ignore its data.json here.
notes/.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-copilot/data.json
notes/.obsidian/plugins/copilot/data.json
notes/.obsidian/plugins/remotely-save/data.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private agent skills.
#
# `.agents/skills/` holds the author's own tooling documentation. The site's
# docs pages read from the vault's `notes/docs/` folder instead, so a skill can never
# be published by accident. This ignore is the second line of defence.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.agents/
.claude/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Site build artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.local

# garden/ 的构建产物由它自己的 .gitignore 管：
# 字体、Excalidraw 渲染岛、画布场景、以及从 notes/ 同步进来的笔记副本。


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local scratch
*.bak
.bak/
